/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Local dev artifacts: generated keys and credentials should never be committed.
*-signing-key
agent-key
agent-credential
control-plane-signing-key

# apt repo: reprepro's generated state (dists/, pool/, db/, lists/) and any
# GPG key material live only on the hosting server / CI runner — only
# apt-repo/conf/* (the repo definition) is source-controlled. See
# deploy/apt-repo.md.
apt-repo/dists/
apt-repo/pool/
apt-repo/db/
apt-repo/lists/
# Private key material only — a public keyring meant for distribution
# (e.g. deploy/harbory-archive-keyring.asc) is fine to commit.
secring.gpg
*.private.gpg
